A stylized logo for the Fruit Slot Machine App. The logo should feature a classic slot machine silhouette in the center, with three spinning reels. Each reel should display a stylized fruit icon (Apple, Banana, Cherry, Lemon) in a simple vector style. The background should be a clean white canvas. The logo should convey fun and excitement, with a subtle gradient or shadow to give depth. The overall composition should be balanced and centered, suitable for use as a website favicon and header image.
